    "description": "🔥 TWO LEGENDS. ONE CHOICE. 🔥\n\nBefore modern chase cards… there were artists who defined Pokémon forever.\n\n🎨 Mitsuhiro Arita — the mind behind some of the most iconic, powerful artworks in Pokémon history.\n⚡ Ken Sugimori — the original Pokémon designer whose clean, timeless style built the foundation of the entire franchise.\n\nDifferent styles. Same legacy.\nBut today… you have to choose.\n\n👇 TEAM ARITA or TEAM SUGIMORI — who wins this artist battle?\n\n🗳️ Vote in the poll and defend your side in the comments.\nCollectors know… this is harder than pulling a holo in 1999.\n\n#pokemoncards #pokemoncollector #pokemonnostalgia #pokemontcg #vintagepokemon",
